lines=['# Complete screen and wireframe catalogue','',f'All {len(F["routes"])} App Router `page.tsx` routes are included. Route variables are placeholders, not example authorization. Composed controls include shared layout imports, re-exports and local dynamic imports; visibility expressions determine what actually renders. This is a source-backed wireframe/control reference, not a claim that every shared component appears simultaneously.','', 'Detailed field/button specifications are in [UI_CONTROLS.md](UI_CONTROLS.md). The source metadata in [frontend.json](catalogue/frontend.json) also records complete attributes, conditions, state expressions, request arguments and dynamic collections.','',table(['Route','Screen','Access'],[(r['route'],spec[r['route']][0],spec[r['route']][1]) for r in sorted(F['routes'],key=lambda r:r['route'])]),'']
